  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>Biologist trained in microfluidics. I design and build microfluidic platforms end to end - CAD, 3D-printed molds, clean-room processes, live imaging and automated image analysis - to follow microbial growth down to single cells. My next goal: a <b>scalable fabrication strategy for functional 3D microfluidics</b>, in an academic lab or with industry.</p>
