  </div>

  <h2>Current research</h2>
  <div class="item">
    <h3>A pump-free microfluidic platform from a single 3D-printed mold</h3>
    <div class="meta">PhD, 2023 - January 2027 · supervisors E. Deprez, B. Le Pioufle, S. Bensalem</div>
    <ul>
      <li>PDMS chip with 400 gravity-trap wells, cast from one 3D-printed mold, operated with a pipette: no pump, no clean room.</li>
      <li>On-chip light × chemical gradient screening: 100 conditions × 4 replicates per chip, up to 9 chips per run.</li>
      <li>Multi-day time-lapse imaging of microalgae and bacteria down to single cells, with an automated image-analysis pipeline.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="item">
