    <p style="margin:0">Low-cost microfluidic platform to monitor early growth from single microalgal cells in bacteria co-culture.<br>
    R. Honigsberg, R. Ghasemi, J. F. Audibert, E. Deprez, B. Le Pioufle, S. Bensalem.</p>
  </div>

